() Tj T*
(PART 2  SecureDataMask Component) Tj T*
(- Reusable component <SecureDataMask value="123456789012" />; masked by) Tj T*
(  default \(XXXX-XXXX-9012\). Tap to Reveal shows full value; button flips) Tj T*
(  to Tap to Hide with aria-pressed.) Tj T*
(- Auto re-mask after exactly 10s; manual hide masks instantly; timers) Tj T*
(  cleared on hide/unmount/re-reveal. Revealed value stays only in local) Tj T*
(  state; never logged, never in URLs/localStorage/aria attributes.) Tj T*
(- Accessibility: focusable button, visible focus ring, aria-live status) Tj T*
(  announces revealed/hidden, WCAG-sufficient contrast.) Tj T*
(- Note: masking is a UI privacy control, NOT cryptographic protection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
