(- Service worker \(public/service-worker.js\): GET /api/credentials handled) Tj T*
(  network-first; latest OK response cached in Cache Storage; on network) Tj T*
(  failure serve cached list; if none, return [] JSON fallback. Non-GET) Tj T*
(  requests are never cached; old caches purged on activate.) Tj T*
