(  main.jsx. UI shows Online/Offline chip and banner.) Tj T*
(- Security note: Cache Storage is unencrypted per-origin device storage ) Tj T*
(  demo caches mock data only; production needs TTLs, logout purge, TLS,) Tj T*
(  disk encryption.) Tj T*
